<title>USA: Edison Mission sells Canada oil interests.</title>
<headline>Edison Mission sells Canada oil interests.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edison Mission Energy, a unit of Edison International, said Wednesday it completed the sale of its interests in B.C. Star Partners to Remington Energy Ltd for approximately $68 million.</p>
<p>B.C. Star is an oil and gas partnership between Texaco Canada Petroleum Inc and Mission Energy Canada Corp (a wholly-owned subsidiary of Edison Mission Energy) which owns interests in 11 producing properties in British Columbia, Canada.</p>
</text>
